{"pageid":1598,"title":"Resource Hub","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Resource Hub</span>","revid":20882,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Resource Hub</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/96/NewResourceHub.webp/revision/latest?cb=20240629082236\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"NewResourceHub\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/96/NewResourceHub.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240629082236\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/96/NewResourceHub.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240629082236 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/96/NewResourceHub.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240629082236 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"NewResourceHub\" width=\"270\" height=\"186\" data-image-key=\"NewResourceHub.webp\" data-image-name=\"NewResourceHub.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.37.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 18th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Resource Hub</b> is a primary location and an important aspect of gameplay. Speaking to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a> will allow the player to sell any of their resources that they have placed within the checkered yellow lines for convenience. Selling your goods in the fireplaces located on either side of the Resource Hub avoids this tax. Speaking to Rej Junkman will allow the player to expand their property and buy <a href=\"/wiki/Property\" title=\"Property\">basement</a> for $125,000.\n</p><p>Material prices in the game dynamically update every <b>6 hours (00:00, 6:00, 12:00, 18:00 EST)</b> according to the in-game stock market. If a large number of players sell a particular material, the increased supply causes its price to drop. For the list of in-game materials can be sell click <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub_(Material_list)\" title=\"Resource Hub (Material list)\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Current_sell_prices\">Current sell prices</span></h2>\n<p>Please add some info here (Including all resource categories). You must add change \ndate.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:95px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"ResourceHub_front-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:93px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:ResourceHub_front.png\" title=\"ResourceHub front.png (174 KB)\" style=\"height:93px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/70/ResourceHub_front.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240308133107\" title=\"ResourceHub front.png (174 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"93\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ResourceHub front.png\" data-image-key=\"ResourceHub_front.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"ResourceHub front.png (174 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"93\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"ResourceHub front.png\" data-image-key=\"ResourceHub_front.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/70/ResourceHub_front.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240308133107\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Resource Hub was added during the map revamp (Version 1.37.0), and completely replaced <b><a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a></b> as well as the selling bins alongside the <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a></b></li>\n<li>Unlike selling at either of the previous locations, resources sold here will not experience any gain/loss in price depending on whether they are wood or stone/ore</li>\n<li>Behind <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\">Jer Junkman</a>, there is a fake floor. Upon entering, you will see a bunker. In the first section, there is a hologram in the middle. On the left, there is a <a href=\"/wiki/Floord_Putter\" title=\"Floord Putter\">Floord Putter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Joop_Barrow\" title=\"Joop Barrow\">Joop Barrow</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sellner_Explorer\" title=\"Sellner Explorer\">Sellner Explorer</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Oakmobile\" title=\"Oakmobile\">Oakmobile</a>, each on a shelf. In the second section, on the right, there are 3 screens with a <a href=\"/wiki/Reinforced_Axe\" title=\"Reinforced Axe\">Reinforced Axe</a> piercing the middle screen. On the top, it says THE (super cool and awesome) INDEX. On the left, there is a giant stone hotdog, rat, buff moai, an axe in a pot, and a pig head.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav\" title=\"Template:Locations Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Locations_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data